# ── AIR full local integration (added by air-web-console: make platform-env) ──
#
# air-classifier-service's .env.example leaves the gateway token commented out, so a
# fresh checkout answers on Tiers 0 and 1 only. This development token is the one
# air-model-gateway's .env.example maps to the air-classifier-service identity; it
# switches on Tiers 2 and 3. Remove this block to go back to the default.
AIR_CLASSIFIER__MODEL_GATEWAY__TOKEN=air-classifier-dev
# ── end AIR full local integration ──
